OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start, with patchy
OL,6,Frain turning heavier and more
OL,7,Fpersistent from the southwest. Rain
OL,8,Fturns to showers into the afternoon,
OL,9,Fheavy at times. Feeling unpleasant,
OL,10,Fespecially towards the coasts with
OL,11,Fstrong northwesterly winds developing
OL,12,Flater.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FPatchy rain possible tonight,
OL,15,Fwith clearer spells developing towards
OL,16,Fdawn, allowing temperatures to dip
OL,17,Fwith a touch of frost. Strong winds
OL,18,Ftowards the coast at first add to the
OL,19,Fchill.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
