OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA bright start to the new
OL,6,Fweek, with sunny spells. Remaining dry
OL,7,Fthough feeling chilly. Though turning
OL,8,Fwet and windy into the evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,11,FRemaining chilly and unsettled.
OL,12,FBlustery, occasionally heavy showers
OL,13,Fon Tuesday with strong coastal winds.
OL,14,FWinds ease Wednesday, though remaining
OL,15,Fshowery. Further rain arrives on
OL,16,FThursday with strong winds returning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
